, \"-\") && len(args[0]) > 1 {\n\t\t\t\tfmt.Fprintf(os.Stderr, \"hostid: unrecognized option '%s'\\n\", args[0])\n\t\t\t\tfmt.Fprintln(os.Stderr, \"Try 'hostid --help' for more information.\")\n\t\t\t\tos.Exit(1)\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t\tgoto done\n\t\t}\n\t}\ndone:\n\n\tif len(args) > 0 {\n\t\tfmt.Fprintf(os.Stderr, \"hostid: extra operand '%s'\\n\", args[0])\n\t\tfmt.Fprintln(os.Stderr, \"Try 'hostid --help' for more information.\")\n\t\tos.Exit(1)\n\t}\n\n\thostid, err := syscall.SysctlUint32(\"kern.hostid\")\n\tif err != nil {\n\t\tfmt.Fprintf(os.Stderr, \"hostid: %v\\n\", err)\n\t\tos.Exit(1)\n\t}\n\n\tif _, err := fmt.Fprintf(os.Stdout, \"%08x\\n\", hostid); err != nil {\n\t\tos.Exit(1)\n\t}\n}\n```\n\n### Pattern Details:\n\n1. **Copyright Header Format:**\n   - Line 1: `// Copyright (c) 2026 Petar Djukic. All rights reserved.`\n   - Line 2: `// SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT`\n   - Line 4: Implementation reference comment (e.g., `// Implements srd048-hostid R1.1-R1.2, R2.1-R2.2.`)\n\n2. **--help and --version Flag Handling:**\n   - Flags are checked in a manual loop using `switch` on `os.Args[1:]`\n   - `--help` prints `helpText` constant and exits with 0\n   - `--version` prints `versionText` constant and exits with 0\n   - `--` terminates option parsing (using `goto done`)\n\n3. **Error Message Format:**\n   - **Unknown flags:** `\"utility-name: unrecognized option 'flag'\\n\"` + hint line\n   - **Extra operands:** `\"utility-name: extra operand 'arg'\\n\"` + hint line\n   - **Hint format:** `\"Try 'utility-name --help' for more information.\\n\"`\n   - Errors are written to stderr using `fmt.Fprintf(os.Stderr, ...)`\n\n4. **SIGPIPE Handler Installation:**\n   - Called as the first line in `main()`: `sys.InstallSIGPIPEHandler()`\n   - Implementation in `/private/var/folders/dl/cbns6zkx7txc7pt64b6cgzp40000gn/T/go-unix-utils-worktrees/5187/pkg/sys/sigpipe.go`\n   - Uses `signal.Notify` with a buffered channel and goroutine that exits with code 0 on SIGPIPE\n\n5. **Version Pattern:**\n   - Uses a `const versionText` (not a variable)\n   - Format: `\"program-name (go-unix-utils) dev\\n\"`\n   - This pattern is consistent across all utilities (hostid, arch, true, etc.)\n   - No external version constant/variable across utilities—each utility defines its own in the const block"}],"totalDurationMs":24899,"totalTokens":24266,"totalToolUseCount":10,"usage":{"input_tokens":6,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1579,"cache_read_input_tokens":21454,"output_tokens":1227,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1579},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":6,"output_tokens":1227,"cache_read_input_tokens":21454,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1579,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1579,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"toolStats":{"readCount":6,"searchCount":1,"bashCount":3,"editFileCount":0,"linesAdded":0,"linesRemoved":0,"otherToolCount":0}}}
